{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ti-1-intro","title":"1 Timothy 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>Comfort. 16; Isa 51:3,12; 57:15; 61:1,2; 66:13; Ro 15:13; 2Co 1:3-6 stablish. 3:3; Isa 62:7; Ro 1:11; 16:25; 1Co 1:8; 2Co 1:21; Col 2:7; 1Th 3:2,13 Heb 13:9; 1Pe 5:10; Jude 1:24 in. Jas 1:21,22; 1Jo 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-1-1","title":"1 Timothy 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Timothy is put in mind of the charge which was given unto him by Paul at his going to Macedonia. 5 Of the right use and end of the law. 11 Of Saint Paul's calling to be an apostle; 20 and Hymenaeus and Alexander.</p>\n<p>an apostle. Ro 1:1; 1Co 1:1 by. 2:7; Ac 9:15; 26:16-18; 1Co 9:17; Ga 1:1,11; 2Ti 1:11; Tit 1:3 God. 2:3; 4:10; Ps 106:21; Isa 12:2; 43:3,11; 45:15,21; 49:26; 60:16; 63:8 Ho 13:4; Lu 1:47; 2:11; 2Ti 1:10; Tit 1:3; 2:10,13; 3:4,6; 2Pe 1:1 1Jo 4:14; Jude 1:25 is. Ro 15:12,13; Col 1:27; 2Th 2:16; 1Pe 1:3,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-1-2","title":"1 Timothy 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Timothy. Ac 16:1-3; 1Th 3:2 my. 18; 1Co 4:14-17; Php 2:19-22; 2Ti 1:2; 2:1; Tit 1:4 Grace. Ro 1:7; Ga 1:3; 2Ti 1:2; Tit 1:4; 1Pe 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-1-3","title":"1 Timothy 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>at. Ac 19:1-10 when. Ac 20:1-3; Php 2:24 charge. 4:6,11; 5:7; 6:3,10,17; Ga 1:6,7; Eph 4:14; Col 2:6-11; Tit 1:9-11 2Jo 1:7,9,10; Re 2:1,2,14,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-1-4","title":"1 Timothy 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>to. 4:7; 6:4,20; 2Ti 2:14,16-18; 4:4; T